  {
    "field": "claim.doc",
    "value": "VC dimension of homogeneous linear halfspaces is exactly n (Cover 1965; Vapnik–Chervonenkis). The class signClass (coordSpace n) of homogeneous linear halfspaces of ℝⁿ has VC dimension equal to the ambient dimension n: the Dudley bound gives ≤ n, and the n standard basis points are shattered, giving ≥ n."
  },
  {
    "field": "claim.decl_name",
    "value": "FLT.Halfspace.vcDim_halfspace_eq"
  },
  {
    "field": "claim.pretty",
    "value": "∀ (n : ℕ), VCDim (Fin n → ℝ) (signClass (FLT.Halfspace.coordSpace n)) = ↑n"
  },
